    "body": "`PROCESS_VERSION 7` · PR #750 · one cross-platform gate. `cargo xtask gate quick|batch|release|test <name>` (with `--dry-run`) and `cargo xtask decisions --version X.Y.Z` replace the logic of `scripts/gate.ps1`, `gate.sh` and `collect-decisions.*`. The scripts are now thin wrappers, so the old commands still work. AGENTS.md, the agents and the skills name `cargo xtask gate` as the one command. `xtask/` and `.cargo/config.toml` are now process files.\n\n**Forks:** sync process files, adding the new paths: `git checkout upstream/main -- AGENTS.md .claude/agents .claude/skills .claude/PROCESS_VERSION scripts/gate.ps1 scripts/gate.sh scripts/collect-decisions.ps1 scripts/collect-decisions.sh xtask .cargo/config.toml`. If your fork's code is on a tag older than this, also add `\"xtask\"` to the workspace `members` in `Cargo.toml` in the same sync commit, or the wrappers fail. The `release.ps1` port is still open (#749).\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
