    "body": "`PROCESS_VERSION 8` · PR #751 · `cargo xtask release --version X.Y.Z --no-tag [--skip-gate] [--skip-build] [--installer] [--dry-run]` replaces `scripts/release.ps1`, which is now a thin wrapper. The cut runs on Windows, macOS, Linux and FreeBSD:\n- **Phases:** the same ten phases as before.\n- **Gate:** it runs the `gate release` tier.\n- **Build:** only the product crates are built.\n- **Zip:** it includes `NOTICE`, as `release.yml`'s does.\n- **Packaging:** on Windows it still calls `sign.ps1` and `installer.ps1`. Elsewhere it uses `package-*.sh`; `--installer` is refused by name and signing is skipped.\n- **Tags:** still made by hand on main after the release PR merges (step 4).\n- **AGENTS.md:** the release step and the fix-only hand-test line name the new command. The hand-test runs on a scratch branch, not main.\n\n#748 and #749 are closed. **Forks:** sync process files as in the issue body (`xtask` is already in the list since version 7).\n",
